 when President Obama  targeted staples but when I hear large  corporations that make billions of  dollars in profits trying to blame our  interest in providing health insurance  as an excuse for cutting back workers  wages shame on them  president Trump's new economic adviser  Larry Kudlow today played down the  president's attacks on Amazon  saying his intent is to quote level the  playing field between online retailers  and land-based retailers with respect to  taxes Chris Doug thank you
 

